        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Black silk bobbin lace with a row of conjoined medallions containing rosettes, eight-pointed stars, and Maltese crosses. The space above and below has long leafy stems on a plaited ground of quatrefoil diaper. Smaller similar rows of medallions form the top and bottom borders."@en , "Black silk bobbin lace; Malta; ca.1850."@en ;
